### Get all Things
POST {{host}}/thing/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "collection_name": "siguri"
}


### Get Things by ID list
POST {{host}}/thing/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "collection_name": "siguri",
  "ids": ["thing_123", "thing_2"]
}

### Search
POST {{host}}/thing/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "collection_name": "siguri",
  "model_encode_name": "puppet-o5",
  "sentence": "demo@ex.com"
}


